# const { setRawMode } = $cpp("ProcessBindingTTYWrap.cpp", "createBunTTYFunctions"); setRawMode(inspected, { valueOf: converted })
# The binding answers an object of the table, so a member of it is a function with a row: it looks at the descriptor and converts the mode, which calls what lies under `valueOf`.
